WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:02.200
So once we learn our WHY

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.000
we have the opportunity to apply it in
all different parts of our lives.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.600
So for jobs for example

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.000
we want to work for a company that
our WHY complements

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.780
the company's WHY.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.364
We're more likely to "fit."

00:00:13.364 --> 00:00:16.340
We've more likely to feel like we "belong."

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:19.439
It goes with our friends too 
believe it or not.

00:00:19.439 --> 00:00:20.400
We do it inherently

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.500
there's lots of nice people in the world

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.640
but we're not friends with everybody in the world.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.342
We're friends with the people that 
we share values with

00:00:26.342 --> 00:00:28.260
but sometimes we have people in our lives

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.240
that we may have a good time with them

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.809
but it's not a deep meaningful relationship.

00:00:32.809 --> 00:00:36.900
Knowing your WHY actually helps you
understand why the deep meaningful relationships

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.356
are the deep meaningful relationships.

00:00:39.356 --> 00:00:44.149
It's a new way of understanding the value
of people in our lives.

00:00:44.149 --> 00:00:48.760
You know how trust builds.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.700
The opportunity is to use it

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.606
to find things that are more likely
to produce

00:00:54.606 --> 00:00:57.420
joy, success, focus, inspiration

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:00.300
and fulfillment

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.706
in the decisions we make,
the books we read,

00:01:02.706 --> 00:01:05.940
the people we keep in our lives,

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.110
where we invest our time
and where we invest our energy.

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:09.960
We get a limited amount of time
in the day and

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.000
a limited amount of years on the planet.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.200
It's the great equalizer

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:14.549
whether we're rich or poor

00:01:14.549 --> 00:01:16.823
we all have 24 hours in a day.

00:01:16.823 --> 00:01:21.450
And the idea is to
get as much out of those hours

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:23.000
and as much out of those years 
as possible.

